(6294553, 930858, 60173, '<td valign="top">Gah, it pains me that I couldn''t get in on this challenge. I was going to go with a pointed stick myself, heh. This is one of my all time favorite sketches. I suppose it''s a good thing that since I couldn''t do it myself that one of my favorite site photographers took a stab at it... with a banana! Ahh!</td>', 'Gah, it pains me that I couldn''t get in on this challenge. I was going to go with a pointed stick myself, heh. This is one of my all time favorite sketches. I suppose it''s a good thing that since I couldn''t do it myself that one of my favorite site photographers took a stab at it... with a banana! Ahh!', '2011-01-26 03:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
