(6294836, 931748, 96751, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=45631" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ramblinr</a>?? AWESOME setup.  Very clever and well done.  My only tiny nit is that the lighting for the box seems to be from a different setup.   The light on the fingers is also odd, and I can''t discern the source for the highlight on the camera left side of the face.  Details, to be sure.  Good luck!</td>', ' ramblinr?? AWESOME setup.  Very clever and well done.  My only tiny nit is that the lighting for the box seems to be from a different setup.   The light on the fingers is also odd, and I can''t discern the source for the highlight on the camera left side of the face.  Details, to be sure.  Good luck!', '2011-01-26 11:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
