(6295052, 930858, 119417, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, and very good expression--it made me grin. I think I could use a little more fill on the left, as well as more light on the background. I''m torn on the composition--I sort of feel like I want the elbow and head not to be clipped, but as it is it may feel closer, which is probably what you want here.</td>', 'Nice lighting, and very good expression--it made me grin. I think I could use a little more fill on the left, as well as more light on the background. I''m torn on the composition--I sort of feel like I want the elbow and head not to be clipped, but as it is it may feel closer, which is probably what you want here.', '2011-01-26 14:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
